<report>
<line><title>Effect size meta-analysis</title></line>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>J(N-2)</th><th>g</th><thfirst><ci>Exact <in>pc</in>% CI</ci></thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="exact"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>gj</in></td><td><in>g</in></td><td><ci><in>lci</in></ci></td><td><ci><in>uci</in></ci></td><td><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></td></tr></block>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>N (exptl.)</th><th>N (ctrl.)</th><th>d</th><thfirst><ci>Approximate <in>pc</in>% CI</ci></thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="approximate"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>ne</in></td><td><in>nc</in></td><td><in>d</in></td><td><ci><in>lci</in></ci></td><td><ci><in>uci</in></ci></td><td><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></td></tr></block>
</table>
<block name="poolok">
<line></line>
<line><subtitle>Fixed effects (Hedges-Olkin)</subtitle></line>
<line>Pooled effect size d+ = <in>dplus</in> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <in>from</in> to <in>to</in></ci>)</line>
<line>Z (test d+ differs from 0) = <in>z</in>  <pval><in>p</in></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line><subtitle>Non-combinability of studies</subtitle></line>
<line>Cochran Q = <in>qc</in>  (df = <in>df</in>)  <pval><in>xp</in></pval></line>
<line>Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = <in>tausq</in></line>
<line>I&#xb2; (inconsistency) = <in>isq</in>% (<ci><in>pc1</in>% CI = <in>llisq</in>% to <in>ulisq</in>%</ci>) </line>
<line></line>
<line><subtitle>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</subtitle></line>
<line>Pooled d+ = <in>dsrd</in> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <in>dsll</in> to <in>dsul</in></ci>)</line>
<line>Z (test d+ differs from 0) = <in>dz</in>  <pval><in>dp</in></pval></line>
</block>
<block name="egger">
<line></line>
<line><subtitle>Bias indicators</subtitle></line>
<line>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's <in>tau</in>  <pval><in>p2</in></pval></line>
<line>Egger: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_egger</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><in>p</in></pval></line>
</block>
</report>
